coverage.run] source so the Gate's coverage run measures only product code. Tests, docs, scripts/ tooling, workflow helpers and data/templates no longer count (owner decision 2026-10-16). With source set, a never-imported .py file under these directories is reported at 0% instead of being invisible. Line coverage only (branch = false), as before.\n\nThe Gate's coverage-min and config/coverage-baseline.json were set at the old all-files reading; they are reset from this run's measurement in a follow-up commit on this branch.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* ci(coverage): reset the Gate floors to the product-only reading (84)\n\ncoverage-min 86 -> 84 in pr-00-gate.yml and line 86.0 -> 84.0 in config/coverage-baseline.json, taken from this PR's own Gate payload (run 38964793528: 12,317 of 14,660 statements = 84.02%, floored to 84). The measure changed (product code only), so this re-bases the floors rather than lowering them: the previous 86 was set at the old all-files reading, which read 88.81% on the same code.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","timestamp":"2026-10-16T21:42:29Z","author":{"name":"stranske","email":"stranske@gmail.com"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com"}},"repository":{"id":996036804,"node_id":"R_kgDOO15QxA","name":"Portable-Alpha-Extension-Model","full_name":"stranske/Portable-Alpha-Extension-Model","private":false,"owner":{"login":"stranske","id":23046322,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDQ2MzIy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23046322?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stranske","html_url":"https://github.com/stranske","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stranske/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stranske/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stranske/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.